{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:40:36+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:40:36+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Aalberts N.V.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Netherlands","city":"Utrecht","website":"https://www.aalberts.com","employees":13000,"summary":"Aalberts N.V., together with its subsidiaries, offers mission-critical technologies for building, industry, and semicon markets in Europe, the United States, the Asia Pacific, the Middle East, and Africa. The company operates through Building, Industry, and Semicon segments. It offers hydronic flow control systems for heating and cooling to enhance energy efficiency; integrated piping systems to distribute and control liquids and gas; advanced mechatronics specializing in vibration isolation, ultra precision frames, and high purity fluid systems; and surface technologies for surface treatments, heat treatments, polymer coatings, brazing, additive manufacturing, and post processing. It sells its products under the BROEN, Henco, ISIFLO, MIFA, and Metalis brands. The company was formerly known as Aalberts Industries N.V. and changed its name to Aalberts N.V. in April 2019. Aalberts N.V. was founded in 1975 and is headquartered in Utrecht, the Netherlands.","exchange":"Amsterdam","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Aalberts N.V., avec ses filiales, propose des technologies critiques pour les marchés du bâtiment, de l'industrie et des semi-conducteurs en Europe, aux États-Unis, en Asie-Pacifique, au Moyen-Orient et en Afrique. La société opère à travers les segments du bâtiment, de l'industrie et des semi-conducteurs. Il propose des systèmes de contrôle de flux hydronique pour le chauffage et le refroidissement afin d'améliorer l'efficacité énergétique; systèmes de tuyauterie intégrés pour distribuer et contrôler les liquides et les gaz; mécatronique avancée spécialisée dans l'isolation des vibrations, les cadres ultra-précis et les systèmes de fluides de haute pureté; et technologies de surface pour les traitements de surface, les traitements thermiques, les revêtements polymères, le brasage, la fabrication additive et le post-traitement."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":4440046080,"shares_outstanding":105967676,"trailing_pe":30.143887,"forward_pe":12.407499,"price_to_book":1.8618087,"ev_to_ebitda":10.844,"ev_to_revenue":1.8,"dividend_yield":0.0273,"payout_ratio":0.8273,"beta_yahoo":1.308},"targets":{"current_price":41.9,"mean":49.875,"median":49.75,"high":54.0,"low":46.0,"n_analysts":10,"reco_mean":1.6,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":[],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":788933330,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-13","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.1197,"institutions_pct":0.63441,"institutions_float_pct":0.72067,"institutions_n":197,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":520,"value":21788,"date":"2025-06-30","chg":0.0421}],"funds":[{"name":"Fidelity Puritan Trust-Fidelity Low-Priced Stock Fund","pct":0.0435,"shares":4703100,"value":197059897,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0128999995,"shares":1397025,"value":58535349,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0128},{"name":"Fidelity Investment Trust-Fidelity Series International Small Cap Fund","pct":0.012,"shares":1293435,"value":54194928,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"Tweedy, Browne Fund Inc.-TWEEDY, BROWNE INTERNATIONAL VALUE FUND","pct":0.0108,"shares":1170235,"value":49032848,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0086,"shares":928698,"value":38912447,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0175},{"name":"Fidelity Investment TRT-Fidelity Intl Small Cap Opportunities Fd.","pct":0.0086,"shares":932128,"value":39056164,"date":"2026-0